# HOWTO-test

***
Unit tests
***

The libraries generated by Garamon are tested by the unit tests of the Garamon generator (directory 'tests' of the
generator sources, Catch2 framework):
    * from the generator root directory:
        * 'cmake -S . -B build'
        * 'cmake --build build'
        * 'ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure'
    * at build time, the algebras c3ga, c5ga, e3ga and p3ga (and two test algebras) are generated, and each library
      is compared with an independent reference implementation of the geometric algebra (all products of basis
      blades and of random multivectors, dual, inverse, norms, ...).

To test the library of another configuration file, add it to 'tests/CMakeLists.txt' (see 'garamon_add_algebra_tests')
and write its test source 'tests/algebras/<namespace>_tests.cpp' (see 'tests/algebras/e3ga_tests.cpp').
